  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Energi i sjukv&#xe5;rden</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy in health care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rmedla kunskaper till akt&#xf6;rer inom sjukhusf&#xf6;rvaltningarna om energieffektiviseringar och  milj&#xf6;skydds&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder och p&#xe5; s&#xe5; s&#xe4;tt skapa utrymme f&#xf6;r medicinska investeringar. Utbildning i Polen samt studiebes&#xf6;k i Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at increasing the knowledge within Polish hospitals regarding energy management and environmental protection. The expected results area more efficient management and increased medical investments. Courses and workshpos in Poland and study-visits to Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
